ほどける線 — うえの弁護士事務所 試作（One-line Drawing スタイル）

Picture: drawn entirely by code (one continuous SVG-sampled path, Canvas2D ink renderer, procedural paper).
  Engine files geom.js / ink.js / paper.js / cam.js / hands.js adapted from Lemo-Opuscar (MIT License, © 2026 LemoLab).
Font (SIL Open Font License 1.1, fonts/OFL.txt): Klee One — Fontworks (github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/kleeone)
Music: original score (score.py), physically modelled nylon guitar (core/audio/pluck.py, Lemo-Opuscar, MIT). No samples.
Sound effects: synthesized in mix.py (pen on paper, tap, ink blot, page lift, room tone).
No voice.
